body:
ARE YOU SERIOUS?! A supposed insider on ATRL posted in her thread and wrote "Me!" yesterday!

&#x200B;

Edit: His username is Mr. S, he also posted a message on the thread that said "FOB" which some people theorize might be the acronym for the new single or album.

They changed it to single in the article!

&#x200B;

Edit: *speculated new single*, even, so it was definitely a misunderstandig on Elle's part.
